<title>GREECE: Greece to auction 3/5/7-yr coupon bonds March 19.</title>
<headline>Greece to auction 3/5/7-yr coupon bonds March 19.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Greek finance ministry will auction 150 billion drachmas, 100 billion drachmas and 50 billion drachmas of three-, five- and seven-year fixed coupon bonds respectively on March 19, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Settlement day will be March 21, it said.</p>
<p>It will be the first time Greece will auction five- and seven-year fixed coupon bonds. </p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
